 markerspopup.cpp | 60 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----------------
 markerspopup.h   |  8 ++++++-
 measurements.cpp |  4 ++--
 popup.cpp        | 58 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---------
